---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Secondary Yaza collects, uses, and protects your personal data.">
  <section class="container" style="padding: 3rem 1.25rem 2rem; max-width: 960px;">
    <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="margin-bottom:.5rem;">
        <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 .75rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-40);font-size:14px;max-width:70ch;margin:0;">Last updated: 2026-10-10 · This policy explains what we collect and why.</p>
      </div>

      <section style="margin-top:.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:1.25rem 0 .75rem;font-weight:400;">1. Information we collect</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">We collect the information you provide when registering: your full name, email address, phone number, and password (stored only as a secure hash). When you pay, the payment itself is processed by PayChangu; we store only the transaction reference, amount, and status — never your card details.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">We also keep your wallet balance, referral earnings, purchases, and reading activity so the Service works as expected.</p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:1.25rem 0 .75rem;font-weight:400;">2. How we use your information</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">Your data is used to provide the library, manage your account and membership, process purchases and withdrawals, credit referral bonuses, and send you account-related notifications.</p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:1.25rem 0 .75rem;font-weight:400;">3. Sharing</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with the payment processor (PayChangu) as needed to complete transactions you initiate, and where required by law.</p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:1.25rem 0 .75rem;font-weight:400;">4. Security &amp; retention</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">Passwords are hashed and sessions expire automatically. We keep data for as long as your account exists so your library, membership, and earnings remain accurate.</p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:1.25rem 0 .75rem;font-weight:400;">5. Your rights</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-60);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1rem;">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:support@secondaryyaza.com" style="color:#2458a8;text-decoration:underline;">support@secondaryyaza.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
